			<div class="content" id="post-content-4034230">
									

<p>I was pushed over the edge required for me to upvote.</p>
<p>Then I got to the interview log with the D Class.</p>
<p>Something about it sounded too canned, or serialized, or something. It sounded way too articulate for someone who just went through intense emotional trauma.</p>
<p>Then Dr. Vogel being silly enough to actually mutter the &quot;shaping the future&quot; line a few times&#8230; it just doesn't make sense that they're dealing with an emotionally manipulative entity, and also not screening the lead researcher against emotional manipulation.</p>
<p>Just my nitpick, but it pushed it to a novote for me.</p>

